.vscode

# Ignore compiled BPF objects and every compiled binary (this repo never
# tracks a source file with no extension, and none of our binaries carry
# one either). Ignore everything first, then explicitly keep directories
# navigable and un-ignore anything with a dot in its name; *.o/*.out come
# last so they stay ignored even though they contain a dot.
*
!*/
!*.*
!LICENSE
*.o
